  "reference": "Bagabīji 18",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 30,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "18",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "LEV 18"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "18",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ngilo kūlaala na ndūgū wa bbihī",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA ūlūngalūnga nū Musa ūhaya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bawīlage a Baisilaeli gīkī, “Ū nene nalī SEEBA Mulungu wing'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaya a bing'we ū kwīta ūmo bakīītīlaga mu sī ya Misili, ūko ng'walikalaga; nūūlū yaya kwīta gīt'ūmo bakīītīlaga mu sī ya Kanani, ūko nalīmutwaala. Yaya ū kūshilondeela ī shītīle shabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shidimagi ī shilagīlo shane, nīyo mushimīzīle mu katongeelele kane mu witegeleja. Ū nene nalī SEEBA Mulungu wing'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shidimagi ī shilagīlo shane na a katongeelele kane; nguno būlī ng'wene ūyo ūzunya kūshimīzīla musho, akūbiza mpanga mu nzīla yasho. Ū nene nalī SEEBA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Atizilonga nūūlū ūmò wa kūlaala na ndūgūye wa bbihī. Ū nene nalī SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaya kūng'wibengeleja so mu nzīla ya kūlaala na noko; ūtizūgima kūlaala nang'hwe, nguno ū ng'wenūyo noko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama yaya nū kūlaala na noko ng'wīnga; ū mhayo gwenūyo gūlī gwa kūng'wibengeleja ū so. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaya kūlaala n'ilūmbūyo, mubize musangīlile sīng'we dūhū, nūūlū musangīlile nining'we dūhū; abize wa kūbyalīlwa ha kaya, nūūlū wa kūbyalīlwa kūngī. Yaya kūlaala nang'hwe ū ng'wenūyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama yaya nūūlū kūlaala na ng'wizūkūlū wako, ūyo alī nshīke wa ng'witūnja wako, nūūlū wa nshīke wako; yaya kūlaala nabo a benabo nguno ū mhayo gwenūyo gūgūkūponda soni ū bebe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nūūlū ū ilūmbūyo wa kūbyalwa na so kūfuma mulī noko ng'wīnga, yaya ū kūlaala nang'hwe; nguno alī ilūmbūyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nūūūlū kūlaala na sengiyo yaya; nguno ū ng'wenūyo ilūmbūye",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18:12",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ilūmbūye:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nūūlū, ndūgūye wa bbīhi (nū Lūhī 13).",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " o ng'wa so. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nū ng'wana wa ng'wawe o ng'wa mayū wako yaya kūlaala nang'hwe; nguno alī nkūlūye nūūlū nzunaye o ng'wa mayū wako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaya kūng'wibengeleja so ntaale nūūlū ū ndo mu nzīla ya kūlaala na nke wakwe; nguno ū ng'wenūyo noko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaya kūgima kūlaala na ng'wīnga wako, nguno ū ng'wenūyo nke wa ng'witūnja wako; yaya gete ū kūlaala nang'hwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama yaya nūūlū kūlaala na nkwelayo; nguno ūkūbiza ūlīng'wibengeleja ū ng'wana wa ng'wing'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nū kūlaala na nkīma, hama wīta walaala na nshīke wakwe, nī chene yaya; yaya gete nūūlū kūsangīlīja na ng'wizūkūlū wakwe wa kūbyalwa na ng'witūnja wakwe, nūūlū wa kūbyalwa na nshīke wakwe. Ū gwenūyo gūlī mhayo gwa malofu; nguno a benabo badūgū bako ba bbihī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama yaya kūlaala na nkīma ūyo ng'wana wa ng'wawe ūntoolile; ūtizūgema kūlaala nang'hwe aho ng'wana wa ng'wawe alīho mpanga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ū nkīma ūlū alī mu shikū jakwe ja ng'weji yaya kūng'wegeela gīkī ūlaale nang'hwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaya kwisosohaja na nke nzenganwa",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18:20",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nzenganwa Ng'wiyo:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ū mhayo ūyo gūtūmamīlilwe mu Bibilia gūlī, ‘nzenganwa ng'wiyo.’ Ū mu Bibilia ū nzenganwa alī munhū ose ose ūyo atī o ha kaya, nūūlū akabiza mutī na būdūgū nang'hwe.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ng'wiyo mu nzīla ya kūshihya nang'hwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bana bing'we yaya ū kūbinha gīkī bayūfunyiwa kūlī Moleki kūbiza shitambò sha kūpemva; nguno mukūlīsosohaja ī lina lya ng'wa Mulungu wing'we. Ū nene nalī SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ngosha yaya kūlaala na ngosha ng'wiye gītī kūlaala na nkīma; ī yenīyo soso yabūbi no. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaya kwisosohaja na shiinū mu nzīla ya kūlaala nayo; nū nkīma yaya kwifunya kūlaala na shiinū, ū gwenūyo mhayo gwa būjimīīji.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Būhūgūji kūlwa būsoso",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“A bing'we yaya ū kwisosohaja mu mhayo nūūlū gūmò gwa yenīyī, nguno ī yenīyī h'ī mihayo īyo yageenheleja kūsosohala a mahanga ayo nalīgapeeja gang'wīngīle a bing'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nī sī bakīsosohaja kūshisha nūyīgwisīja nsango kūlwa shibi shaamo, yūbaswa a bazengi baamo na kale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo a bing'we shing'wigelile mushilang'hane ī shilagīlo shaane, na a katongeelele kane. Yaya ū kwīta ī mihayo ya malofu gīko a bing'we bana byalwa, nūūlū a bageni abo bakwiza kwikala hamò ning'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
