          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bing'we londeelagi gete a katongeelele kane, yaya ū kūshimīzīla mu shītwa sha malofu īsho shītagwa aho mutaalī a bing'we ū kwiza mo; mutizisosohaja mu nzīla ya mihayo yenīyo. Ū nene nalī SEEBA Mulungu wing'we.”",
          "type": "text",
